SUMMARY:JFL All-Star Gala: JFL All-Star Gala - Sydney
LOCATION:Sydney
DESCRIPTION:The festival's crown jewel is back. The Just For Laughs All-Sta
 r Gala returns to the Sydney Opera House Concert Hall for one unforgettable
  night of world-class comedy\, and it sells out every year. This is the Gal
 a that has welcomed some of the biggest names in comedy to one of the most 
 iconic stages on earth.\n\nThis year's Gala is hosted by Melanie Bracewell 
 and Tim McDonald\, the duo behind Network 10's hit The Cheap Seats. Bracewe
 ll is an award-winning New Zealand comedian\, writer and Taskmaster NZ cham
 pion\, known for her quick\, deadpan take on the week's news. McDonald is a
 n Australian comedian\, broadcaster and Have You Been Paying Attention? reg
 ular whose easy charm and impeccable timing make him one of the most in-dem
 and hosts going around.\n\nRhys James and David Nihill bring the internatio
 nal firepower\, alongside home-grown favourites Tom Cardy\, Denise Scott\, 
 Matt Okine\, Geraldine Hickey and Anisa Nandaula\, for a blockbuster\, Sydn
 ey-exclusive night you won't want to miss.\n\nHeld in the breathtaking surr
 ounds of the Concert Hall\, the All-Star Gala is more than a comedy show. I
 t's the night the festival comes alive\, where the laughs are non-stop and 
 the energy is electric from the first act to the last.\n\nOne night. One st
 age. The best in the business. Saturday 21 November\, 7pm. Book now before 
 it sells out.\n\nA Just For Laughs Sydney 2026 event\, proudly supported by
  the NSW Government through Destination NSW\, Strategic Sponsor of Just For
  Laughs Sydney.\n\nLine-up subject to change.\nMore info: https://comedyatl
 as.app/comedy-atlas/event/jfl-all-star-gala-jfl-all-star-gala-sydney/
